{"title":"Orc","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 9 Orc that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/orcish-grip-wrap\">Orcish Grip Wrap</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=9\">Lv 9 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=9\" title=\"Pick level 9\"><td><b>9</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>28</td><td>9.5</td><td>450</td><td class=\"muted\">84 · 13.3 · 1,350</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=11\" title=\"Pick level 11\"><td><b>11</b></td><td>34</td><td>10.6</td><td>550</td><td class=\"muted\">102 · 14.8 · 1,650</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/437e64fc8b90222ab1bd.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/d4c4c3b2f7ca484e3cb0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Deerhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e6cc3f9e2ea9c5729d45.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Imp armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/40ab31e96d5155127378.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Imp armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e3ded7b2026d90b5a4d6.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Imp armor</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 110 total, 9–29 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6 drops</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"orc\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/varruk-the-raider\"><img src=\"data/img/b4178e6f94d79da2c1ae.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Varruk the Raider</b><span>Lv 10</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Orc: <a href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt\">Orc Grunt</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior\">Orc Warrior</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-shieldwall\">Orc Shieldwall</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-berserker\">Orc Berserker</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-warchief\">Orc Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d4c4c3b2f7ca484e3cb0.webp\" alt=\"Orc\"></div><h3>Orc</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>10</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 9)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Orc</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>31</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>10</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>12 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}